window.products.push({"id":1077056,"name":"Katherine's Collection 2020 All That Glitters Angel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":175.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvEH4ljvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED: Everything in this collection is handmade, sewn and painted. Each piece lovingly created by the talented, award winning and nationally recognized artists at Katherine's Collection. These will be treasured pieces for years to come. SPARKLE AND SHINE: The assortment of materials used for this collection is remarkable. Crystals, glass, rhinestones, gems, feathers, and more were used to create a distinctive look for this theme. The combination of white and metallic colors gives luxurious yet modest feel that you will surely appreciate. ENDEARING DECOR: Spread the holiday warmth and cheer with these pieces. Delightful ornaments, figurines and decor that can either be hung on your Christmas tree, on the fireplace mantel or along the entrance way. The festive colors will certainly brighten any room in your house. UPDATED LOOK: The Moonstruck collection brings you back to the traditional feel of Christmas past. The set celebrates your old favorites and giving them a fresh appearance. Holiday nostalgia has never looked this good. THE STORY BEHIND: From its humble beginnings in 1991, Katherine’s Collection continues their mission of creating a broad range of original products each holiday season. Their design team has a depth of experience that is unparalleled in the industry. The extensive skills among the product development team includes pattern making, sculpting, painting and illustrating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvEH4ljvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Katherine's Collection","source_asin":"B084T7B9ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084T7B9ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084T7B9ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077057,"name":"CounterArt Flower Shaped 4 Pack Reversible Easy Care Flexible Plastic Placemats Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVbB79AoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REVERSIBLE SHAPED PLACEMATS- Placemats are reversible, featuring different coordinating designs on both the front and back of each mat. Attractive coordinating designs are great for everyday meals, parties and outdoor entertaining. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA of BPA and PVC free flexible plastic. The flexibility of these Placemats makes for easy clean up. Easily funnel crumbs or meal remnants from the table to the trash receptacle. Then wipe the Placemat clean with soap and water. PROTECTS YOUR SURFACES- Placemats protect your table or countertop from spilled food, scratches, or stains. Placemat material prevents liquids from soaking through to your surfaces. ARTISTIC DESIGN- Beautiful artistic design allow the Placemats to remain displayed even when not in use. Leading, Trending Artists in the industry work with us to create artistic designs that will add beauty and distinction to your Dining Space. Decorative Placemats are an easy way to change the look of your kitchen, dining room, or outdoor eating area. MEASURES- Each Placemat measures 13.5” x 13.5” x 0.15”. Size allows for plate, drinkware, and utensils to fit nicely on the Placemat. Look for CounterArt coordinating Coasters, Lazy Susan Turntables, and Cutting Boards to complete your home design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CVbB79AoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Counterart","source_asin":"B086GZC647","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086GZC647","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086GZC647","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
