window.products.push({"id":1077129,"name":"TEMEIKE 3-IN-1 Evaporative Air Cooler, 35'' Windowless Air Conditioner Portable for Room with Remote, 60° Oscillation, 7H Timer Swamp Cooler, 4 Ice Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZdNNE-EOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【3-IN-1 Air Cooler & Fan & Humidifier】This portable evaporative cooler combines the power of a regular fan, air cooler, and humidifier all in one. Unlike traditional air conditioning units that worsen dryness, this swamp cooler adds moisture to the air, relieving dryness and providing enhanced comfort. Embrace this compact evaporative cooler and free up space in your home. ❄【Stay Cool in Dry Climates】The evaporative air cooler for room utilizes advanced cooling tech to circulate water and airflow, providing a cooling sensation. Perfect as a swamp cooler, it excels in dry areas like California, Arizona, and the Southwest US. The included reusable ice packs amplify the cooling effect, offering 4 times the cooling experience. It's a versatile cooler, perfect for room, home, office, bedroom, kitchen. ❄【Customizable Cooling Options for Maximum Comfort】Our portable air cooler offers 6 unique cooling effects with 2 modes and 3 wind speeds. It's the ultimate small portable air conditioner to beat the heat and stay comfortable. Whether you're in your bedroom or office, you can create a cooling oasis wherever you go. This indoor air conditioner is designed to be energy-efficient, making it the perfect cooling companion for any space. ❄【Modern Swamp Cooler with 35-inch Height】No more struggling with heavy fans. Our room cooler's 35-inch height and integrated handle make it easy to transport and position for optimal airflow. With its compact size, you can effortlessly move this portable ac unit from room to room. ❄【7-Hour Timer & Whisper-Quiet Operation at 50dB】With a 7-hour timer setting, our evaporative cooler for room lets you schedule cooling sessions to match your routine. Operating at a whisper-quiet 50dB, it creates a serene environment for relaxation, work, or sleep. Enjoy the perfect balance of convenience and tranquility with our tower fan. ❄【Control Panel & Remote for Effortless Operation】TEMEIKE cares about all age range usage experience. Our latest cooling tower fan with remote is designed to be easy to use. You can effortlessly control this portable swamp cooler from anywhere with the included handy remote, which has a 20ft range. Everything you need to enjoy a cool summer comes in the package. Assembly only takes 2 minutes, and you'll be ready to experience a cooling summer breeze. ❄【1.2L Water Tank Capacity】No more hassles of taking the entire cooling fan to the bathroom for refills. The removable water tank of this air conditioner fan allows for effortless cleaning and maintenance, ensuring hygienic and efficient operation. With the 1.2L capacity, you can enjoy continuous cooling without the need for frequent refills. ❄【Easy-to-Clean Water Tank and Cooling Pad】Our ac cooler is designed with a removable and washable water tank, ensuring cleanliness and efficient operation. Please regularly clean this ductless air conditioner to maintain its optimal performance and maximize your comfort. ❄【Outstandingly Energy Saving Cooler】Our brand-new 60W air conditioner portable is designed to be the most cost-effective solution, allowing you to steer clear of expensive window units. With our energy-efficient cooler, stay cool without worrying about skyrocketing utility bills. ❄【Powerful Cooling with 60° Oscillation】No more complicated window installations! Our windowless air conditioner is specially designed for rooms, ensuring efficient cooling. With a 60° horizontal oscillation, it ensures cool air circulates throughout every corner. Choose TEMEIKE air conditioner, transform your room into a cool oasis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZdNNE-EOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEMEIKE","source_asin":"B0C8S8Z8K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8S8Z8K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8S8Z8K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
