window.products.push({"id":1077228,"name":"Barrel Aged Whiskey Making Kit - Create Your Own Kentucky Bourbon Whiskey - The Outlaw Kit from Skeeter's Reserve Outlaw Gear - MADE BY American Oak B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFZlGiIJL._AC_SL1003_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Handcrafted Construction Combined elements of oak, fire and steel, American Oak Barrel creates the finest oak barrels in our industry. Handcrafted American white oak staves cut & fitted precisely around two equal heads of oak and perfectly bound by 6 hoops of steel! In-house Staff Our trained staff working the phones, processing orders, creating and setting the engraved designs to ensure a positive experience. Customer Service Our team of knowledgeable individuals are ready to service any barrel needs you may have. Whether its help with curing your barrel or replacing a leaky spigot, they will get you up to speed in no time. It's one of the perks of becoming a member of our Outlaw Family. Inhouse Art Design We have an extensive library of custom created designs to utilize for any occasion. Our custom engraved barrels are frequently gifted and nothing comes close to a personalized oak barrel MADE BY American Oak Barrel. Place it in a room and pour yourself a few lasting memories right from the tap! Custom Laser Engraved Personalization Our engravers offer state of art technology, calibrated precisely to ensure constant power and speed delivery to the barrel head surface. Please note that no ink is used in the engraving process. Any fluctuations in the finished burn is solely \"Nature's\" doing as combinations of hard and soft grains can yield some contrasting results. This is part of the beauty that makes it truly unique and guaranteed to be a \"one of a kind\" treasure. Fastest Turnover Times Keeping everything in-house gives American Oak Barrel the necessary control needed to meet the tightest turnover demands. Order Processing, Art Design, Proof Reading, Engraving, Packing & Shipping all executed seamlessly under one roof! That's how most custom orders are completed and shipped same day! That's really good news when you need a great gift fast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFZlGiIJL._AC_SL1003_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Oak Barrel","source_asin":"B00WIQ8IKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WIQ8IKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WIQ8IKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
