window.products.push({"id":1077342,"name":"Mary Mulari Designs Church Ladies Apron Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mSQBf87ML._AC_.jpg","description":"MARY MULARI DESIGNS \"CHURCH LADIES' APRON\" Sewing Pattern This apron pattern was inspired by a vintage 1950's apron with bias tape wrapped edges, a tiny pocket, and a single layer of fabric. The apron was a style commonly worn by ladies serving food in church basements. This pattern updates the style and adds modern, common sense details like double or single pockets sewn at a slant so it's easy to get your hands inside and a neck yoke that can be adjusted for individual fit. The apron is reversible so one yard of fabric is required for each side. Decorate the apron front or pockets with machine embroidery, sew a Velcro closure for an opening in the neck yoke to avoid ruining your hairdo, or mix and match fabrics so that all sections of the apron feature different prints. There's lots of possibilities for this pattern! Make one for yourself and for gifts too. NOTE: This is a sewing pattern ONLY, NOT a finished product, YOU have to make it yourself (^O^)/**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mSQBf87ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARY MULARI DESIGNS","source_asin":"B00MWBX99Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MWBX99Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MWBX99Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077343,"name":"Reusable Food Bags 8-Pack Extra-thick Reusable Storage Sandwich Bags Freezer Bags Leak Proof Reusable Snack Bags FDA Grade PEVA Lunch Food Bag Seal Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c5bRkhKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know According to relevant scientific reports, humans have produced 18.2 trillion pounds (about 8.26 billion tons) of plastics, but less than 9% of all of the plastic have been recycled. The average family use up to 2000 plastic bags per year( Not to say that your family is “average”, but you know what we mean.) Plastic ends up in landfills where it can take hundreds of years to break down. And if the plastic doesn’t end up in a landfill, it could end up in the ocean, where it can cause pollution and marine animal deaths. Why choose Mery reusable storage bags ♻ Reuable & durable :One Mery Reusable Bag CAN SAVE Up To 350 Disposable Bags ♻ Leak Proof: Upgraded storage bag closures provide an airtight leakproof seals in freshness. Never worry about the food juice leaking and staining your bag. ♻ Easy to close & open for kid: The zipper is designed with an upgraded wide side and adds a non-slip design that makes it easier to open or close. Mothers no longer have to worry that children can't open lunch bags at school. ♻ Freezer safe: keeps food fresh looger and helps preserve the original flavor of food. ♻ Eco-friendly :PEVA is a eco-friendly and recyclable material that is not harmful to the environment when disposed of or burned. ♻ All purpose reusable storage bags: perfect for dry snacks (cereal, nuts, chips, etc) or for smaller fruits and veggies (berries, cut up celery or carrots, etc) cosmetics, jewelry make-up, stationery, travel and more. Package includes 8 x reusable snack bags","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c5bRkhKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mery","source_asin":"B07XBFGC4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XBFGC4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XBFGC4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077344,"name":"Vegan Leather PVC Blue Placemats Set of 4 - Easy To Clean - Machine Washable, Heat Resistant, Non Slip, Stain Resistant - Kid Friendly Farmhouse Desig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bw7Yh1yeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our PVC placemats are the perfect addition to any dining table. With a set of 6, you'll have enough for every place setting and then some. These placemats are ideal for daily use as they are washable and easy to clean. Simply wipe them down with a damp cloth or throw them in the dishwasher for a more thorough clean. The grey color of these placemats is neutral and will match any decor. Not only are these placemats functional, but they also add a touch of style to your table. The PVC material provides a sleek and modern look, while the individual placemats allow for a customizable table setting. Mix and match with other colors or stick with a cohesive set for a cohesive look. These placemats are not only great for daily use, but they are also suitable for special occasions. The set of 6 allows you to set a formal table for dinner parties or other events. The PVC material is durable and able to withstand the wear and tear of frequent use. Plus, it's easy to maintain and clean. Simply wipe down the placemats with a damp cloth or toss them in the dishwasher for a more thorough clean. They are also resistant to stains, making them perfect for messy eaters or spills that may occur during meals. These placemats are not only practical, but they also add a touch of sophistication to your table setting. The sleek, modern material and neutral grey color complement any decor, making them suitable for any occasion. Whether you're hosting a formal dinner party or just enjoying a casual meal with your family, these placemats will add a touch of elegance to your table. In addition to their practical and stylish nature, these PVC placemats are also environmentally friendly. The PVC material is free of harmful chemicals and is safe for both you and the planet. Plus, the durability of the placemats means that you won't have to constantly replace them, reducing waste. Overall, these PVC placemats are a practical and stylish choice for any dining table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bw7Yh1yeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooler Kitchen","source_asin":"B0B6QSQC2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6QSQC2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6QSQC2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
