window.products.push({"id":1077364,"name":"Ziplock Bag Organizer for Drawer - Upgraded Improved Ziploc Bag Organizer with SIX Slots for Gallon, Quart, Sandwich, Snack PLUS Quart Slider Bags and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j7vXjF8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅100% NATURAL BAMBOO AND CRAFTSMANSHIP: This plastic bag organizer is made of Premium quality bamboo. Well-built quality and fine craftsmanship make it stronger, more durable and will last for years. Bamboo is a great alternative to plastic and is very versatile as it is a renewable resource that brings a warm and natural feel to your Home. ✅COMPATIBLE WITH MOST BRANDS: Our ziploc bag organizer Compatible with Ziploc, Solimo, Hefty, Glad, Great Value and various brands. Perfect for holding sliders, sandwiches, quarts, snacks and gallon bags. GREAT SIZE: 14.25\" x 10.75\" x 2.75\". Please make sure your drawers and shopping bags are the correct dimensions. ✅LID WITH HINGS AND LOCKS: As other products are available with sliding lids that lose over time due to friction between the lid and the storage bag organizer. Also some sellers are providing with magnetic lids, which also lose magnetism over time and can cause injury if removed accidently. Our unique and durable, design make our products long lasting, eco-friendly and safe. ✅VALUE PACK: Our baggie organizer has Laser engraved letters that will last a lifetime for easy identification, rather than Labeling stickers. We are also providing 06 clips for food packages and It also comes with 04 non-slip rubber feet to keep it fit in place. You can use it with absolute confidence. This is sustainable for the planet and keeps your bag free of chemicals and toxins. ✅EXCELLENT CUSTOMER CARE: We not only provide quality products at competitive prices, but also provide excellent customer service. Your satisfaction is our first priority. If you have any questions, feel free to ask. We are Glad to assist you. NOTE: Don't put this ziplock bag organizer for drawer in dishwasher or soak it in water. BUY & ENJOY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j7vXjF8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KACHIC","source_asin":"B09TMFHZXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TMFHZXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TMFHZXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077365,"name":"Handicraft 3D Fish painting for desk decoration, living room decor - unique lucky gift (Fish Couple in Rattan Basket)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cUZqO6vtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ History of 3D fish painting art It’s hard to believe, but the lively goldfish swimming in bowls are not real at all! A Japanese artist named Riusuke Fukahori is painting these incredibly realistic three-dimensional goldfish using acrylic paint layered over clear resin. Just like 3D printer, the artist paints the fish layer by layer, with the sandwiched slices revealing slight more about each creature. His art works inspire many artists around the world to learn and create many outstanding 3D paintings. ✅ How is the 3D fish painting made? Each artwork is pure handmade and are carefully painted by artist. The stunning three-dimensional paintings were created by layers of resin and painted to create depth. With gleaming scales and beautiful movement, these fishes make you feel owning a real fish tank as small as a bowl. However, on close inspection, it becomes clear that these are clever optical illusions. The painstaking process is the artist begins with a thin layer of resin, which he then paints fish onto using acrylic. Gradually, layer by layer, more details are added to bring the animals to life and create the optical illusion. On top of the sandwiched layers of resin are drawn animals before allowing the resin to settle and pouring another layer on top. Every product may take more than 15 days for drying and drawing completely. At ViHAFA™, we surely believe that the product is gorgeously valuable and you'll love it. ✅ Care and handling instruction: 1. Please rest the art object on a surface out of reach of children 2. Resin arts are fragile collectible objects. Avoid abrasion, puncture and fracture 3. Do not scratch the surface with sharp objects such as fingernails 4. Clean gently with soft cotton cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cUZqO6vtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ViHAFA","source_asin":"B07MMYS971","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMYS971","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMYS971","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077366,"name":"WoodWick Fireside Reed Diffuser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+LFz3lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our signature fragrance balances the natural scents of amber, vetiver and musk to perfectly capture the essence of a cozy evening by a warm fire","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+LFz3lkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WoodWick","source_asin":"B001N41KLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001N41KLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001N41KLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1077367,"name":"Bake-Pro Round Brotform, 8.2-Inch, Light Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gOlCsXtOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Excellent brotforms and great price. Bake-Pro brotforms are exceptionally well constructed and traditionally shaped. Bake-Pro brotforms comply with the general requirement (Article 3) in European Union Regulation (EC) No. 1935/2004 on materials and articles intended to come into contact with food. Made of all natural, premium quality white cane. Hand crafted bread mold made of cane, brotform, also known as brotformen or banneton, is used to form and shape artisan loaves during the proofing/raising stage. Before You Use it The First Time - Wipe with a cloth towel. Use Your Brotform - First prepare the basket by coating it thoroughly with flour and shaking out the excess, then place the kneaded dough in the basket until it rises. After dough has risen, take the dough out and transfer it to a baking sheet for oven baking. Do not put the brotform in the oven, it is not for baking. Cleaning Your Brotform - After each use, shake and brush out excess flour. You may rinse it lightly, but remember to hand dry it with a towel right away after rinsing. Let your Brotform air dry thoroughly before storing the basket. All Dimensions are Outside and Top Rim Measurements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gOlCsXtOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAKE-PRO","source_asin":"B007RZ0056","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007RZ0056","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007RZ0056","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
