window.products.push({"id":1077476,"name":"Baxton Studio Denver Modern Kitchen Cart/Island with Butcher Block Top, Natural, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":254.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ixLQdPyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The contemporary home cook can't go without two things in the framework of her kitchen: plentiful storage and appropriate appliances. Our Denver Kitchen Island covers your need for storage and then some. This multifunctional kitchen cabinet is a freestanding island that features four wheels for legs, each with a locking feature so it doesn't slip away while you are chopping fresh herbs and veggies. A towel bar, cabinet with concealed shelf, wine rack shelf and two open shelves provide plentiful space for cookware, non-perishables and sundries. The frame is made with a blend of engineered wood and rubber wood and is painted white at the base. Topping this is a beautiful solid wood butcher block countertop. This modern kitchen island requires assembly and is made in Malaysia. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth. Product Dimension:41.5\"W x 17.7\"W x 35.8\"H-Left side drawer:14.5\"Wx10.5\"DX2.2\"H, shelf dimension 16.7\"Wx14\"Dx (4\"-8.5\"-8.5\") H from top to bottom, the lower shelf is removable. Right side storage behind door with removable shelf :upper:16.5\"H x 14.5\"Dx14.7\"W, lower:13\"H x 14.5\"D x 14.7\"W.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ixLQdPyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B008UOWX6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008UOWX6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008UOWX6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
