window.products.push({"id":1077645,"name":"42Pcs Giant Halloween Window Clings, 6 Sheets Double-Side Removable Spooky Window Sticker for Halloween Party Decoration - 6 Large Monster Silhouette ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p0-IgnhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Large Monster Window Clings - 6 sheet 15.7*27.5in jumbo window clings, they are bigger than normal cartoon window stickers and assorted various demon and monster style patterns. And many other spooky patterns, such as spider, dead tree, cat, bats, and an assortment of clings meet your needs to decorate your window. Removable Material - Removable window static stickers are made of high-quality PVC material, durable and reusable, and easy to stick, you just peel them from the sheet, and then stick them on the clean and smooth window, it will work well for a long time. Quality painted with black could see very clear out of the window at the night. Easy to Use - Don't need any glue. Before you stick the bat window clings on the window, you need to sprinkle some water on the window and then wipe clean, If blisters appear, please use your hands or tools to drive the water out. You can decorate your walls for Halloween in minutes. Creative Halloween theme! Widely Application - Cute monster Clings are ideal for decorating your car, truck, wall, laptop, tablet, window, cooler, or anywhere you want to stick them. Decorate your windows and mirrors with Halloween colors. This monster decal is 15 inches long and can stick on any clean smooth surface. Beautiful Decoration - There are many spooky window stickers accessories, including a dead tree, bat, spider, and cat perfect for a Halloween party. In fact, they are not only windows decal, you also can put them on anything that of which surface is smooth, such as furniture, floor, tiles, mirrors, and even tables. Enjoy the happiness on Halloween Day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p0-IgnhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LACCHOUFEE","source_asin":"B0B51SCLL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51SCLL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51SCLL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
