window.products.push({"id":1077987,"name":"Bitray Candle Wick Trimmer, Polished Silver Stainless Steel Wick Trimmer Wick Clipper Candle Scissors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G6f50USfL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Color Silver Material Stainless steel Total Size 18 x 6cm/7 x 2.4 inch(L x W) Package Includes 1pcs x Candle wick trimmer Precautions ❀ 1. The first time you light a scented candle, let it burn for 2 to 3 hours until all the wax on the surface has become liquid. ❀ 2. Trim the wick regularly with the wick trimmer (ideal length: 3 - 5 mm) ❀ 3. Candle’s wick should be trimmed after every 4 hours of burn time, then trim the wick to 1/8 inch before relighting. ❀ 4. When extinguishing the candle, check the wick is upright and centered. Please Note Please trim the wick prior to lighting. If the exposed wick becomes too long as the candle burns, blow out the candle and let it cool. Trim the wick again before re-lighting. About Maintenance After use, the position where the scissors head touches the candle will occupy the candle oil, just wipe it with a paper towel or a rag. Welcome to Bitray Store If the product you receive has any problem, please don't worry. Just contact us and we will offer you a satisfactory solution. Feel free to contact us if you have any question. We will be here for you all the time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G6f50USfL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bitray","source_asin":"B08S7GWKFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1077987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7GWKFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7GWKFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
